      (∀ q ∈ Ioo q_lo q_hi, ∀ x > c_inf, θ_min ≤ |2 * σ * Real.sqrt x - q| ∧ |σ| * Real.sqrt x ≤ C_θ * |2 * σ * Real.sqrt x - q|) → (∀ x ≤ c₁, a x = 0) → IsAirySymbolBound 4 a M →
